7:2-7:9 warning deprecated_keyword: ':RESUME' is legacy error handling. Prefer ':TRY' / ':CATCH' / ':FINALLY'
15:37-15:43 warning deprecated_keyword: ':ERROR' is legacy error handling. Prefer ':TRY' / ':CATCH' / ':FINALLY'
15:37-15:43 error unexpected_token: Unexpected keyword ':ERROR' - expected an expression
